Explain Simply

An AI-powered web app that helps people understand complex topics through simple, easy-to-understand explanations.

Live Demo

https://explain-simply-6qpta1zpe-kdryan.vercel.app/

Tech Stack

- React
- TypeScript
- Vite
- Tailwind CSS
- Google Gemini API
- Node.js
- Express
- Vercel

Deploy Your Own Version

1. Fork this repository.
2. Import it into "Vercel" (https://vercel.com/).
3. Configure the required environment variables in your project settings.
4. Deploy and enjoy your own version.

